@startuml
title Home Tax Collection System - Activity Diagram
start
:Admin generates home tax for all homes in area;
:Send tax bill to home owner;
:Owner views tax bill;
if (Deadline near?) then (yes)
  :Send reminder message to owner;
else (no)
endif
if (Owner pays tax?) then (yes)
  if (Online payment?) then (yes)
    :Pay tax online;
  else (no)
    :Pay tax offline;
  endif
  :Update payment status;
  :Issue receipt;
else (no)
  :Deadline crossed;
  :Intimate owner and admin;
  :Admin takes corresponding action;
endif
stop
@enduml
